  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 5 ranks, Performance sphere ((lyric) package).</p>\n<p>Your lyrics use tone, empathy, or similar methods of conveying meaning without language, no longer treating them as language-dependent effects, in addition to allowing you to use either verbal or visual components for your lyrics.</p>\n<p>You may select this talent a second time when you possess at least 10 ranks in Perform (comedy, oratory, or sing). If you do, you can have your lyrics be conveyed purely through telepathic thought and intent, removing the need for any components for a lyric used this way; a mindless creature still cannot be affected by a lyric used this way.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc63\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
